 },
 "summary": "RVT100UF35V167RV0082 is a polarised aluminium electrolytic capacitor in a 6.3 mm diameter, 5.4 mm tall surface-mount can, from the general-purpose RVT series. It holds 100 µF ±20 % at 35 V DC, works from -55 °C to +105 °C and is rated for 2000 hours under load at +105 °C. It ships in embossed tape on reels of 1,000 and suits reflow soldering.",
